{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51746","headline":"嘲僧门祝辟支佛牙 · 杨德辉","name":"嘲僧门祝辟支佛牙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"比来降诞爲官家，堪笑羣胡赞佛牙。\n手软阿师持磬钹，面甜童子执幡花。\n纵饶黎庶无知识，不可公王尽信邪。\n捧拥一函枯骨立，如何延得寿无涯。\n（以上《监诫录》六《旌论衡》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨德辉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}